        <body>
            <div xml:id="d140">

                <pb facs="0236" n="230" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg230"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 115.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Commissioner of the United States to China</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Peking, China</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1901-06-12"><hi rendition="#italic">June 12,
                                1901</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith for
                    your information a translation of the note addressed by the dean of the
                    diplomatic corps to the Chinese plenipotentiaries concerning the carrying out of
                    Article IV of the Joint Note which provides for the erection of expiatory <pb
                        facs="0237" n="231" xml:id="pg231"/> monuments in the foreign cemeteries in
                    China which were desecrated last year; also of the reply of Chou Fu, treasurer
                    of the province of Chih-li, stating the steps which it is proposed to take to
                    settle the matter.</p>
                <p>Exclusive of the cemeteries desecrated at Pekin, mentioned in the latter note,
                    there is, I understand, one at Hsüan-hua Fu, in this province. This will be
                    stated in the reply to the latter note by the Dean, and the matter will be
                    promptly settled.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Rockhill.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d140-a1.xml" xpointer="d140-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d140-a2.xml" xpointer="d140-a2"/>
